    <!-- Filmes que já vêm no catálogo na primeira abertura do app -->
    <string name="filme_homem_aranha">Spider-Man: Brand New Day</string>
    <string name="sinopse_homem_aranha">Forgotten by everyone he loves, Peter Parker fights crime full-time as Spider-Man while a change in himself and an invisible villain put the city at risk.</string>
    <string name="filme_odisseia">The Odyssey</string>
    <string name="sinopse_odisseia">Christopher Nolan adapts Homer: after the Trojan War, Odysseus faces gods, monsters and the sea on his long voyage back home to Ithaca.</string>
    <string name="filme_toy_story">Toy Story 5</string>
    <string name="sinopse_toy_story">Woody, Buzz and the gang must compete for Bonnie\'s attention with a brand-new rival for playtime: a tablet.</string>
    <string name="filme_michael">Michael</string>
    <string name="sinopse_michael">A biopic of Michael Jackson, from the Jackson Five years to the start of his solo career as the King of Pop.</string>
    <string name="filme_mario">The Super Mario Galaxy Movie</string>
    <string name="sinopse_mario">Mario and Luigi travel across the stars to stop Bowser Jr., who wants to free his father and restore the family name.</string>
    <string name="filme_diabo_prada">The Devil Wears Prada 2</string>
    <string name="sinopse_diabo_prada">Andy Sachs returns to Runway, where Miranda Priestly fights to keep the magazine alive in a new media world, now facing her former assistant Emily.</string>
    <string name="filme_devoradores">Project Hail Mary</string>
    <string name="sinopse_devoradores">A science teacher wakes up alone on a spaceship, with no memory, on a mission to save Earth from a dying Sun.</string>
    <string name="filme_minions">Minions &amp; Monsters</string>
    <string name="sinopse_minions">The Minions conquer Hollywood, lose it all and release monsters on the world, and then must team up to fix the chaos they caused.</string>
    <string name="filme_mandaloriano">The Mandalorian and Grogu</string>
    <string name="sinopse_mandaloriano">After the fall of the Empire, the New Republic recruits the bounty hunter Din Djarin and his apprentice Grogu to hunt down Imperial warlords.</string>
    <string name="filme_hoppers">Hoppers</string>
    <string name="sinopse_hoppers">With a technology that moves human minds into robot animals, the animal lover Mabel discovers secrets of the animal world. A Pixar film.</string>

    <!-- Avaliações de exemplo dos usuários fictícios -->
    <string name="avaliacao_exemplo_1">Nolan nailed it again. The scenes at sea are breathtaking.</string>
    <string name="avaliacao_exemplo_2">Great Spider-Man movie, but the villain could have been used better.</string>
    <string name="avaliacao_exemplo_3">I cried again. Woody\'s gang never disappoints.</string>
    <string name="avaliacao_exemplo_4">Best sci-fi of the year, and the book was already amazing.</string>
    <string name="avaliacao_exemplo_5">The songs are amazing, but the story moves too fast.</string>
    <string name="avaliacao_exemplo_6">Fun from start to finish, full of references to the games.</string>
    <string name="avaliacao_exemplo_7">Miranda is still the best part. Worth the wait!</string>
    <string name="avaliacao_exemplo_8">Grogu steals every scene.</string>
    <string name="avaliacao_exemplo_9">Creative and cute, Pixar at its best.</string>
</resources>
